{"id": 21, "name": "Hayabusa", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/3/35/Hero211-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141115", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Burst"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["40", "50", "10", "50"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "The young leader of the Shadow Sect who wields his blade through moonless nights, walking the path of nindo without fear.", "skills": [{"name": "Ninjutsu: Trace of Shadow", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1255ed2b33be690a777dce8a797557c1.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Hayabusa's attacks apply a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Mark</span> on hit (up to 4 stacks). Each stack lasts 6s and increases Hayabusa's damage to the enemy by 5%."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Phantom Shuriken", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2291f23ec06da9b9f312dd985bfd47a9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4   Energy Cost: 30", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Hayabusa permanently gains 3% Spell Vamp.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Hayabusa throws three returning shurikens in the target direction, each dealing 220<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 35% for 2s. Subsequent hits on the same enemy deal 70% less damage (only 50% less to creeps). He also restores 10 Energy when hitting non-minion enemies."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Quad Shadow", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_76a4c1e8322ddec04759efa14a3ab3ff.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 16   Energy Cost: 25", "desc": "Hayabusa dashes in the target direction and releases four phantoms that travel in separate directions. The phantoms will remain at the end of their paths or attach themselves to the first enemy hero hit, dealing 130<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing them by 40% for 2s. Hayabusa will immediately stop if he hits an enemy hero during the dash.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Hayabusa teleports to a phantom's location and reduces the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ninjutsu: Phantom Shuriken</span> by 1s. If the phantom is attached to an enemy hero, he also deals 130<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the enemy."}, {"name": "Ougi: Shadow Kill", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_725ee5582eb697e37896e8a6b81442d9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40", "desc": "Hayabusa blends into the shadows and launches 6 single-target attacks on enemies in the area, each dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+32% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\n\nThe attacks prioritize enemies with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Mark</span> and each will consume a mark to deal 90<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Extra Physical Attack)</span> extra <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. Shadow Kill does not apply <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Mark</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Flame Hunter's Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8db29d866ea977468d370d3ac1f3311f.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f523b2a5fb397bd5f37475b5f0b4fbd1.p